					"content": "唔…好，我想出来了，灯谜有了一句",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "清昼"
				},
				{
					"id": 710330901,
					"content": "好了，这样灯谜就写好了，我们去轻策庄里去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710330902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "清昼"
				},
				{
					"id": 710330902,
					"content": "去了那边，我再把灯谜告诉你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "清昼"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7103310,
